ELECTRA attribution
------------------
This project builds on the ELECTRA architecture and replaced-token detection
research by Kevin Clark, Minh-Thang Luong, Quoc V. Le, and Christopher D. Manning:
"ELECTRA: Pre-training Text Encoders as Discriminators Rather Than Generators"
https://arxiv.org/abs/2003.10555

The original Google Research ELECTRA implementation was released under the
Apache License, Version 2.0, not MIT:
https://github.com/google-research/electra
Copyright 2020 The Google Research Authors (as credited in upstream model code).
