an external dependency. Transformers is licensed under Apache License 2.0:
https://github.com/huggingface/transformers

No upstream implementation source or pretrained model weights are vendored in
this repository. Our additions configure causal self-attention and implement
causal corruption, learning objectives, and experiments around that dependency.
